    "scenesThatPass": [
      "BECCA: I said no! Just kidding I SAID YES!\nHARPER: We're not old enough to get married.",
      "KIRSTEN: You're talented. Stop trying to convince us. Cut every adjective and send it back to me and we'll see what we really need.\nWRITER: Totally. Thank you so much, Kirsten. This is so helpful.\nWRITER: Kirsten is amazing. You're so lucky to work for such a nice person!\nKIRSTEN: I'm taking a nap. Wake me up at midnight.",
      "KIRSTEN: Okay, let's not make this any worse.\nHARPER: Why did you stop it?!",
      "KIRSTEN: I'll need breakfast and a coffee before I get here tomorrow morning. Sometime between 6 and 9. And I need those articles sent to my iPad sin…\nHARPER: I didn't realize you wanted hard copies. I can print--\nKIRSTEN: You're bad at your job. If I pay you to make my life easier but you're making it harder, you're useless to me. Do you understand that?",
      "HARPER: What are you gonna do, go to another godforsaken baby shower?\nKIRSTEN: I could use a massage."
    ]
